{"success":true,"code":null,"message":null,"requestId":"T54ca5215f979438e8cad27645cecc88d","data":{"contentData":{"id":"RAW_0866439a","displayDocument":"<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div style=\"padding:20px 1em;margin:0px 10px 24px;max-width:100%;letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75em;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:justify;\">\n   <p style=\"margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bolder;font-family:Optima-Regular,PingFangTC-light;\"><span style=\"\"><span>关注腾讯云开发者，一手技术干货提前解锁\uD83D\uDC47</span></span></span></p>\n   <p class=\"mp_profile_iframe_wrp\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 8px;padding:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"></p>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>今天，腾讯云数据库团队全球正式开源&nbsp;</span><strong><span>TencentDB Agent Memory</span></strong><span>。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>一套面向 AI Agent 的分层记忆引擎，项目采用&nbsp;</span><strong><span>MIT 协议</span></strong><span>开源，开箱即用。</span></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=4ba81dbd&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FDkmqcxOVbCnArkBsuqP7wfp9qWcJhJBcrlz2OnvUpH5XAJT34L8ClIzRfZvcv5HoUDp3iaVNtH0XE52iaL2A5Pkbsd7ciaJGnVcb2muicejQ7ws%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg%26tp%3Dwebp%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%23imgIndex%3D1\"></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=54c4318d&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FDkmqcxOVbClT4ia6d2tVRhVpWnpmhwS6vkWzO4iazeU5SGniaL0XpMNbQ8JCM3dE2dJKSJOotoDepMVwu88KkSt7nH8V94GxYCBt7svfSDW2rM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg%26tp%3Dwebp%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%23imgIndex%3D2\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>⭐</span><span>项目主页：<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Tencent/TencentDB-Agent-Memory\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/Tencent/TencentDB-Agent-Memory</a></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>在当前主流的 Agent 架构中，Memory 已经从\"加分项\"变成了\"标配组件\"。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>无论是面向 C 端的对话助手，还是面向开发者的长周期 Agent，底层都依赖类似的\"记忆层\"承</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>载跨会话偏好与历史经验，并逐渐收敛出一套通用的接口范式。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>TencentDB Agent Memory 正是在这一背景下诞生的：让 Agent 学会你的工作流程、保留任务上下文、复用历史经验——以符号化记忆化解单次长任务的信息过载，以分层记忆沉淀跨会话的经验资产。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>在超长 session 评测中发现，Agent Memory 作为 OpenClaw 插件接入后：最高节省</span><strong><span>&nbsp;61.38</span></strong><strong><span>%</span></strong><span>&nbsp;Token，通过率相对提升&nbsp;</span><strong><span>51.52</span></strong><strong><span>%</span></strong><span>；PersonaMem 准确率从&nbsp;</span><strong><span>48%</span></strong><span>&nbsp;提升到&nbsp;</span><strong><span>76%</span></strong><span>。</span></p>\n  <table>\n   <thead>\n    <tr>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>记忆能力</span></strong></th>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>Benchmark</span></strong></th>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>Openclaw 成功率</span></strong></th>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>加插件后成功率</span></strong></th>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>相对变化</span></strong></th>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>Openclaw Token &nbsp; 消耗</span></strong></th>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>加插件后 Token 消耗</span></strong></th>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>相对变化</span></strong></th>\n    </tr>\n   </thead>\n   <tbody>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>短期记忆</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>WideSearch</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>33%</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>50%</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>51.52%</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>221.31M</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>85.64M</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>−61.38%</span></strong></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>短期记忆</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>SWE-bench</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>58.40%</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>64.20%</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>9.93%</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>3474.1M</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>2375.4M</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>−33.09%</span></strong></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>短期记忆</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>AA-LCR</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>44.00%</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>47.50%</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>7.95%</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>112.0M</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>77.3M</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>−30.98%</span></strong></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>长期记忆</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>PersonaMem</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>48%</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>76%</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>59%</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>—</span></p>\n     </td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>—</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>—</span></strong></td>\n    </tr>\n   </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>目前，TencentDB Agent Memory 已作为 OpenClaw 记忆增强插件，在生产环境中验证效果。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 8px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:0.544px;text-decoration-style:initial;line-height:1.6em;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\">\n   <div style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;visibility: visible;\">\n    <p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 4px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"></p>\n    <h1 style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;font-weight:bold;font-size:28px;line-height:40px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:0px;-webkit-text-stroke:3px rgb(66, 66, 66);max-width:100%;font-family:inherit;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: normal;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">01</span></span></h1>\n    <p></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:0.544px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\">\n   <div style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\">\n    <p style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:17px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 8px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;text-decoration-style:initial;line-height:1.5em;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:bold;font-size:16px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;text-decoration-style:initial;line-height:1.5em;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\">准确</span></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>当下主流 AI Agent 的记忆方案，大多做的是同一件事：把对话历史压缩成一段摘要，然后在下次会话时注入上下文。这在短对话里够用，但在真实的长周期任务中会暴露三个问题：</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>●&nbsp;</span><strong><span>跨会话断裂</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong><span>昨天反复确认的代码规范，今天新开会话又全忘了</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>●&nbsp;</span><strong><span>事实与偏好混淆</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong><span>用户说过\"我用 TypeScript\"和\"帮我查一下天气\"，这两条信息的价值完全不同，但被同等对待</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>●&nbsp;</span><strong><span>上下文膨胀</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong><span>任务越长，堆进上下文的历史信息越多，Token 消耗持续攀升，模型注意力也在衰减</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>TencentDB Agent Memory 通过把不同粒度的信息放在不同的\"楼层\"，构建分层式长期记忆能力来解决以上长周期任务问题：</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>L0 原始对话层全量保留每一轮交互；</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>L1 原子记忆层自动提取事实、偏好、约束、阶段结论；</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>L2 场景归纳层按任务自动聚合；</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>L3 用户画像层持续蒸馏出稳定的长期画像</span></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=591ff1de&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FDkmqcxOVbCmJCkmZjgEAK4PdkaC7p6QGKlnNrPR8khuEuLcdSQjIu90Ea88Hwa5wjKhmBRS7pmKBsDldVGBn3uFxFWZAtYWtd4kG9EcYFEQ%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg%26tp%3Dwebp%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%23imgIndex%3D4\"></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>每一层只做一件事，层与层之间通过提取-聚合-蒸馏的管道连接，任何一层都可以独立升级或替换，让Agent 不再因为换了一次会话就忘掉你是谁。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align: