quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:center;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:1px;text-decoration-style:initial;line-height:1.5em;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\">快速开始</span></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>GitHub 仓库中提供了 OpenClaw 、Hermes Gateway 接入方案，开箱即跑。</span></p>\n  <h3 style=\"font-size:15px;color:#3B82F6;line-height:1.5;margin:0;\"><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span>.</span></strong><strong><span>Openclaw&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span>一行</span></strong><strong><span>安装</span></strong></h3>\n  <pre style=\"border-radius:6px;padding:15px;margin:0;overflow-x:auto;\"><code style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span>openclaw plugins install @tencentdb-agent-memory/memory-tencentdbopenclaw gateway restart</span></span></code></pre>\n  <h3 style=\"font-size:15px;color:#3B82F6;line-height:1.5;margin:0;\"><strong><span>2.&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span>Hermes Gateway（Docker，需版本号 ≥ 0.3.</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong></h3>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>除 OpenClaw 外，本插件也支持 Hermes Agent。（<a href=\"https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent）\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent）</a></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>一行命令即可启动带记忆能力的 Hermes：</span></p>\n  <pre style=\"border-radius:6px;padding:15px;margin:0;overflow-x:auto;\"><code style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span>dockerrun-d\\--name hermes-memory \\--restart unless-stopped \\-p8420:8420\\-eMODEL_API_KEY=\"$MODEL_API_KEY\"\\-eMODEL_BASE_URL=\"$MODEL_BASE_URL\"\\-eMODEL_NAME=\"$MODEL_NAME\"\\-eMODEL_PROVIDER=\"$MODEL_PROVIDER\"\\-vhermes_data:/opt/data\\agentmemory/hermes-memory:latest</span></span></code></pre>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>镜像支持 linux/amd64 和 linux/arm64。内置腾讯云 DeepSeek-V3.2 默认配置，如需自定义模型可额外传入 MODEL_BASE_URL、MODEL_NAME、MODEL_PROVIDER。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>验证：</span></p>\n  <pre style=\"border-radius:6px;padding:15px;margin:0;overflow-x:auto;\"><code style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><span>curl<a href=\"http://localhost:8420/health#\" target=\"_blank\">http://localhost:8420/health#</a> 检查 Gateway 状态dockerexec-ithermes-memoryhermes# 进入 Hermes 对话</span></span></code></pre>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>记忆不是让 AI 记住所有事，而是让人不必重复所有事。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>我们把 TencentDB Agent Memory 放到开源社区，是因为相信记忆这个产品远没有标准答案，比起做一个完美的方案，我们更想和开发者一起，把产品做得更丰富、更扎实、更可用，从而帮助更多 Agent 沉淀经验，让人更专注于创造。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>欢迎所有形式的共建——提一个 issue，发起一次discussion，对一个早期项目而言，每一种反馈，都是贡献。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px 8px 8px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:0.544px;text-decoration-style:initial;line-height:1.6em;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\">\n   <div style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;visibility: visible;\">\n    <p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 4px 0px 8px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;\"></p>\n    <h1 style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;font-weight:bold;font-size:28px;line-height:40px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:0px;-webkit-text-stroke:3px rgb(66, 66, 66);max-width:100%;font-family:inherit;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: normal;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">05</span></span></h1>\n    <p></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-