es:normal;widows:2;\">相关链接</span></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <table>\n   <thead>\n    <tr>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>资源</span></strong></th>\n     <th style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;font-weight:500;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>链接</span></strong></th>\n    </tr>\n   </thead>\n   <tbody>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>GitHub</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span><a href=\"https://github.com/Tencent/TencentDB-Agent-Memory\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/Tencent/TencentDB-Agent-Memory</a></span></p>\n     </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>npm</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span><a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tencentdb-agent-memory/memory-tencentdb\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tencentdb-agent-memory/memory-tencentdb</a></span></p>\n     </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>官网介绍</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span><a href=\"https://cloud.tencent.com/product/agm\" target=\"_blank\">https://cloud.tencent.com/product/agm</a></span></p>\n     </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>PersonaMem 评测集</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span><a href=\"https://github.com/bowen-upenn/PersonaMem\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/bowen-upenn/PersonaMem</a></span></p>\n     </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>OpenClaw</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span><a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw</a></span></p>\n     </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\"><strong><span>Hermes</span></strong></td>\n     <td style=\"border:1px solid rgb(225,228,233);padding:12px 20px;word-break:break-all;line-height:24px;text-align:left;\">\n      <p><span>GitHub - &nbsp; NousResearch/hermes-agent: The agent that grows with you · GitHub</span></p>\n     </td>\n    </tr>\n   </tbody>\n  </table>\n  <p style=\"margin:0px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">TencentDB Agent Memory 由腾讯云数据库团队开发和维护。如果这个项目对你有帮助，欢迎在 GitHub 上给一个 ⭐。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:bolder;font-size:15px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;visibility:visible;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-decoration-style:initial;line-height:1.81333;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;max-width:100%;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 16px;line-height: 1.7;visibility: visible;\"><span>\uD83D\uDCE2 活动预告</span></span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><strong><span>5月29日，腾讯云「数据库+AI」发布会</span></strong><span>将首次完整披露从“AI-In-Database”原生融合，到全面支撑Agent的演进路径与核心能力。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><span>诚邀您见证“AI 原生重构数据库”的行业变革，共建下一代智能体应用的数据根基。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><strong><span>\uD83D\uDC47 扫码即刻报名！席位有限，先到先得！</span></strong></p>\n  <p><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:260px;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);width:260px;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=a2a3e2f2&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FDkmqcxOVbClOTjibgIibgkEibKzDrbWkzSOFdQPAaY3ACdpy0iaAEwNACMheDicDjKR1TFgx0uUb0TqNcRueFbPiczxEFPSuE3o7G4ZIWtaLecFIM%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg%26wxfrom%3D5%26wx_lazy%3D1%26tp%3Dwebp%23imgIndex%3D2\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;caret-color:rgb(34, 34, 34);font-variant-caps:normal;color:rgb(136, 136, 136);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0.5px;display:inline !important;font-size:12px;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;float:none;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\"><span>-End-</span></span></p>\n </body>\n</html>","edited":true,"updateTime":"2026-05-19T22:23:35.522+00:00"}}}